<dict>
	<key>account.deleteConfirmMessage</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@count@</string>
		<key>count</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>d</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>此账户有 %d 条记录。记录不会被删除,会以无账户的状态保留在「记录」中。如果只是不想再看到它,请将其归档。此操作无法撤销。</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
